### Регистрация пользователя
POST http://localhost:8080/user/registration
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "12345",
  "username": "TestUser"
}

### Логин
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/sign-in
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test@test.com",
  "password": "12345"
}

### Запрос к защищенному эндпоинту
GET http://localhost:8080/user/by-email/test@test.com

### Refresh токена
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/refresh

### Логаут
POST http://localhost:8080/auth/logout